                                                "sense_id": "b8b7a528-6bcd-3f8d-95b7-70a7c37457bd",
                                                "text": "Andrew Sullivan attacks the first premise by arguing that PIB and homosexuality are importantly different, because there are “constitutional” homosexuals, but not constitutional polygamists, “incestualists,” or “bestialists.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb0c0fec-e09a-4842-b0d8-eeb23d6e5c77",
                                                "sense_id": "b8b7a528-6bcd-3f8d-95b7-70a7c37457bd",
